{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18103050","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18103050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1810305001:1":{"text":"修繕屋でひときわ目を引いたのは、巨大なペンチだった。棚には同じぐらい大きなノコギリもあり、診療所でよく見かけるメスなどは、かえって隅に放置されていた。","source_cn":"这是修缮屋里最醒目的工具——钳子，体型巨大。柜子里还收...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10FF434FF2504D1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1810305002:1":{"text":"修繕屋の主が、普通の医者でないことは明らかだ。彼女の仕事は、腕や脚を切り離し、つなぎ直すこと――いわば肉体の「大工」だ。ならば、メスよりもノコギリやナタを使うのもうなずける。","source_cn":"很显然，修缮屋的主人绝非传统意义上的医生。她干的是卸胳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FD2598BFAEDDACA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旁白":{"text":"ナレーション","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}}